    "Ring %lld" : {
      "comment" : "Spoken name of a ring button. The variable is the ring's number.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Anneau %lld"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "第%lld輪"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "第%lld环"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "第%lld環"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ring %lld can’t move while ring %lld is off: ring %lld’s rod runs through ring %lld, and that rod is out of the slot, so ring %lld can’t pass through the slot." : {
      "comment" : "Why a ring cannot move. The first, fourth and fifth variables are the ring tapped; the second and third the ring just before it, which is off. A ring's rod is the wire that holds it; the slot is the gap between the sword's two rails.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "L’anneau %1$lld ne peut pas bouger tant que l’anneau %2$lld est descendu : la tige de l’anneau %3$lld traverse l’anneau %4$lld et n’est plus dans la fente, si bien que l’anneau %5$lld ne peut pas passer par la fente."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "第%2$lld輪が外れているため、第%1$lld輪は動かせません。第%3$lld輪の棒は第%4$lld輪を通っていて、その棒がすき間の外にあるので、第%5$lld輪はすき間を通れません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "第%1$lld环现在不能移动，因为第%2$lld环已取下：第%3$lld环的直杆穿过第%4$lld环，而这根直杆已离开中缝，所以第%5$lld环无法穿过中缝。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "第%1$lld環現在不能移動，因為第%2$lld環已取下：第%3$lld環的直桿穿過第%4$lld環，而這根直桿已離開中縫，所以第%5$lld環無法穿過中縫。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ring %lld can’t move while ring %lld is on: ring %lld’s rod stands in the slot between ring %lld and the tip." : {
      "comment" : "Why a ring cannot move. The first and fourth variables are the ring tapped; the second and third a ring before it (a lower number) that is on. A ring's rod is the wire that holds it; the slot is the gap between the sword's two rails; the tip is the sword's rounded end.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "L’anneau %1$lld ne peut pas bouger tant que l’anneau %2$lld est monté : la tige de l’anneau %3$lld passe dans la fente, entre l’anneau %4$lld et le bout."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "第%2$lld輪がかかっているため、第%1$lld輪は動かせません。第%3$lld輪の棒が、第%4$lld輪と先端の間のすき間をふさいでいます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "第%1$lld环现在不能移动，因为第%2$lld环在框架上：第%3$lld环的直杆立在中缝里，挡在第%4$lld环和前端之间。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "第%1$lld環現在不能移動，因為第%2$lld環還套著：第%3$lld環的直桿立在中縫裡，擋在第%4$lld環和劍尖之間。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ring %lld comes off — %@" : {
      "comment" : "Status while a ring comes off. The first variable is the ring's number, the second the name of the stage the move is in.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
